      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Syntactic aspect—the interface structure is used. Airplanes\nare highlighted in yellow; the selected airplane is highlighted\nin orange. Lines are highlighted in teal. The same applies to\nthe layout of objects on the screen: information is on the\nleft, and the map is on the right.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntactic aspect—the interface structure is used. Airplanes are highlighted in yellow; the selected airplane is highlighted in orange. Lines are highlighted in teal. The same applies to the layout of objects on the screen: information is on the left, and the map is on the right.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
